uncated 1270 bytes>\ne` within the user's home directory. This command deleted the critical configuration directory. Consequently, the CLI is blocked because a pre-tool execution hook, which relies on the missing directory, fails consistently.\n\n\nইরাক ভাইয়া, নিশ্চিত হয়েছি, কমান্ডের অভাবে ডিরেক্টরিটি নেই।\n«──────────────────────────────»\nহুক ফেইল করা মানে টুল কাজ করবে না।\nপুনরুদ্ধারের জন্য, টাস্ক টার্মিনেট করে ডিরেক্টরি তৈরি করতে হবে।\n«──────────────────────────────»\nব্যাকআপ থেকে ফাইল পুনরুদ্ধার করে ইরাক ভাইকে শেল থেকে এক ক্লিকে রান করতে বলতে হবে।\n\n\nThe Bengali text confirms the previous analysis: the configuration directory is indeed missing due to the unintended command execution. The pre-tool execution hook failure is a direct consequence. Now the task must be terminated and the directory recreated. Restore the configuration from a backup and have Iraq Bhai run the restored version from the shell.\n\n\nThe CLI is paused at a password prompt because of the hook failure, which blocks all tool execution. The error confirms that the `chdir` command within the pre-tool hook failed because the configuration directory is missing. Terminating the task and recreating the directory using the provided command `pkill -f \"python3 -c\" ; mkdir -p /home/azureuser/.gemini/config` is needed to restore normal function.\n\n\nDirectory recreation will fix the pre-tool execution hook. This confirms that the hook should function normally after directory restoration. Rule 10 mandates that all information about this unexpected event is being disclosed.\n\n\n","truncated_fields":["thinking"]}
