k Overview\n- **Core Request & Architecture:**\n  Implement the hardened **Master Multi-Agent Hierarchical Architecture (AGY Principal System)**:\n  `YOU (Iraq Bhai via WhatsApp) → AGY:0 (Principal Master) → [Asking & Research (agy:ask), Reporting (agy:report), Action (agy:action)] → Project Agents (8 domain-locked workers)`.\n- **Operational Model:**\n  **\"Approval-less but Policy-Controlled\"**. The user operates headlessly from mobile/WhatsApp and expects full autonomous task execution without interactive terminal prompts (`--dangerously-skip-permissions` is an intentional, permanent operating mode).\n- **Core Safety Philosophy:**\n  Because native prompts are disabled, 100% of autonomous safety rests on the **Policy / Tool Gateway** (Antigravity `PreToolUse` hook). The gateway operates on a strict **Binary ALLOW / DENY** model (no `ask` or `force_ask`):\n  - `Level 0 (READ_ONLY)` → ALLOW\n  - `Level 1 (LOW_IMPACT_REVERSIBLE)` → ALLOW\n  - `Level 2A (ISOLATED_LOW_RISK_CODE_FIX)` → ALLOW (single-file, non-config, tests pass)\n  - `Level 2B (CONFIG_SCHEMA_DEPENDENCY_MULTI_FILE)` → DEFAULT DENY\n  - `Level 3 (DESTRUCTIVE_IRREVERSIBLE)` → ALWAYS HARD DENY (no WhatsApp prompts mid-flight)\n- **Critical Fail-Closed Mandate:**\n  The gateway must NEVER fail-open. Any internal exception, timeout, invalid JSON, unknown agent, unknown tool, or path traversal MUST yield **HARD DENY**.\n- **Application vs OS Boundary Distinction:**\n  Antigravity `PreToolUse` hook is an application-level tool execution filter, NOT an OS-level security boundary. It must be paired with OS-level containment.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Progress\n- **Authoritative Specifications Produced:**\n  - Full 20-Section Architecture Document: [`file:///home/azureuser/MASTER_MULTI_AGENT_HIERARCHICAL_ARCHITECTURE.txt`](file:///home/azureuser/MASTER_MULTI_AGENT_HIERARCHICAL_ARCHITECTURE.txt)\n    - Direct Download: `https://tmpfiles.org/dl/1790321217.479c62e08f79467e/wPwmESubKGRX/master_multi_agent_hierarchical_archi